    "outcome": "fail",
    "explanation": "For the oracle the evidence is complete (agent/trajectory.json, agent/oracle.txt replay log, verifier/golden_trajectory.json with full tool payloads, verifier_summary.json, test-stdout.txt, reward.json/txt, artifacts/manifest.json). But there is no eligible attempt whose submission and grading could be reconstructed, so the criterion's subject is entirely absent."
