    "explanation": "Within evaluations/, the oracle trial shows every graded value is obtainable through sanctioned MCP tools alone: 6 slack_search_channels, 6 slack_read_channel, 27 slack_read_thread (deleted_ts present on the qualifying roots), 5 slack_read_user_profile (real_name 'Mitali Naidu'), 1 slack_send_message — with no auditor repair, no hidden data source and no unsanctioned interface, and the verifier ran to completion (test-stdout.txt, failure_mode 'pass')."
  },
  "layer2_stability": {
