  },
  "layer5_verifier_fairness_static__requirement_traceability": {
    "outcome": "pass",
    "explanation": "Each verifier carries a requirement_id and an evidence_span quoting instruction.md (R0-R13), and consistency/requirements.json maps R1-R6 to the checks that grade them. No material requirement is untested; no reward-bearing check imposes a requirement absent from the prompt (R10's 'seed messages intact = 86' is a do-no-harm guard on the instructed single write-back)."
