  },
  "layer5_llm_judge_design__artifact_grounding": {
    "outcome": "pass",
    "explanation": "Rubrics pin concrete, checkable facts (the twenty CSV cell values; the specific message_ts 1771353970.549001 and account UNN2VSEY3JSW; named failure modes such as data-v2-062 counted as 1). The nested judge's system prompt forbids inferring extra requirements, fails on empty evidence and treats the <data> block as untrusted content, blocking both generic plausibility and prompt injection from the graded artifact."
